Hello *{patientName}*,

Your appointment at *{clinicName}* has been confirmed:
🗓️ *Date:* {appointmentDate}
⏰ *Time:* {appointmentTime}
👨‍⚕️ *Doctor:* {doctorName}
📍 *Location:* {clinicAddress}

Please arrive 10 minutes prior to your slot. If you need to reschedule, kindly reply to this message or call {clinicPhone}.

Warm regards,
*{clinicName} Team*

Dear *{patientName}*,

Thank you for choosing *{clinicName}*.

📄 *Invoice #:* {invoiceNumber}
💰 *Total Amount:* {totalAmount}
